<title>UK: Telewest confirms top appointments.</title>
<headline>Telewest confirms top appointments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telewest Communications, the British cable television and telephone operator, confirmed on Thursday that Stephen Davidson would take the seat of chief executive and Charles Burdick that of finance director.</p>
<p>Davidson has been acting chief executive since last August and Burdick has been acting chief financial officer since last October.</p>
<p>Both appointments would be with immediate effect, Telewest said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7987</p>
